"Shen Yu once went disguised as an old streetsweeper inside the Shrouded Mountain Sect."
"Shen Yu secretly watched over Bi De, Ri Zu, Yun Ren and Fat Han while they were in the north."
"Shen Bu was Shen Yu and Qinxiao's son, raised with every resource and little discipline."
"Shen Bu, resentful of lagging behind his famous parents, turned to demonic cultivation."
"Shen Bu massacred Shen Yu's household, 10,267 people, while his parents were away."
"Shen Bu drained his mother Qinxiao's cultivation and life, killing her and her unborn child."
"Shen Yu killed his own son Shen Bu, by then an Imperial Realm demonic cultivator."
"Shen Yu calls killing his son the worst pain of his life, and swore never to father more children."
"Shen Yu wandered grieving for 300 years, his cultivation nearly unravelling, before finding Jin."
"Shen Yu found and raised a street orphan called Rou, who became Jin, as his legacy disciple."
"Shen Yu was once nearly forced to strike Jin down, after Jin was almost beaten to death."
"Later this year, Shen Yu secretly watches from the sky as Jin repairs Pale Moon Lake's Dragon Veins."
"In time, Shen Yu forges legendary weapons with rare Skyshimmer Spider Silk."
"In time, Shen Yu forges Meiling a new scalpel-blade as a reward for her efforts."
